11. Classification

Code Label Criteria
H Historically documented s \in \mathcal{H}_{\text{obs}}
P Partially documented Individual mechanisms occur historically; complete configuration does not
U Unobserved / plausibly viable s \notin \mathcal{H}_{\text{obs}}, \mathbf{V}(s) \geq \boldsymbol{\theta}, survives simulation and robustness tests
F Infeasible At least one hard constraint violated

Critical: U \neq \text{better} and H \neq \text{optimal}. Classification describes epistemic status, not desirability.

