Appendix C — Data Extraction and Harmonization Protocol

C.1 Pipeline Overview

```
[1] Load D-PLACE CSV  ─┐
                       ├──► [3] Harmonize units ──► [5] Code modalities
[2] Load Seshat CSV  ──┘                            │
                                                    ▼
